@host = http://localhost:5080

### List orders — paged, sorted by total amount desc
GET {{host}}/api/orders?Page=1&PageSize=10&SortBy=TotalAmount&SortDescending=true

### List orders — high priority, confirmed
GET {{host}}/api/orders?Priority=High&Status=Confirmed&PageSize=10

### Create an order (AI analyses the instructions during intake)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Acme Corp",
  "customerReference": "PO-9911",
  "specialInstructions": "URGENT - need same day delivery, customer will pay cash on delivery.",
  "lines": [
    { "productSku": "SKU-0001", "productName": "Standard Bolt", "quantity": 1500, "unitPrice": 3.50 },
    { "productSku": "SKU-0002", "productName": "Heavy-Duty Tape", "quantity": 10, "unitPrice": 8.00 }
  ]
}

### Get order by id (replace the guid)
GET {{host}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Cancel an order (allowed only while Pending)
POST {{host}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel

### Natural-language search (AI → validated filters → same safe query)
POST {{host}}/api/orders/search-nl
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phrase": "high priority orders from last week over 500 units, largest first",
  "pageSize": 10
}

### Product catalog (cached)
GET {{host}}/api/products

### Add a product (invalidates the catalog cache)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-9001",
  "name": "Premium Sealant",
  "category": "Adhesives",
  "unitPrice": 19.99
}
